{"id": "z-cash-0000", "domain": "finance", "category": "cashflow_forecast", "title": "Contractor cash-flow forecast", "difficulty": "extreme", "prompt": "Forecast the general contractor's cumulative cash position month by month.\n\n| Activity | Start month | Duration (months) | Cost |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Sitework | 1 | 5 | $1,318,000 |\n| Foundations | 9 | 1 | $871,000 |\n| Structure | 8 | 5 | $1,287,000 |\n| Envelope | 7 | 1 | $694,000 |\n| Roofing | 10 | 3 | $1,277,000 |\n| MEP rough-in | 2 | 4 | $206,000 |\n| Interiors | 10 | 1 | $1,148,000 |\n| MEP finish | 8 | 5 | $875,000 |\n| Elevators | 4 | 6 | $1,173,000 |\n\nRules: each activity's cost is spread evenly over the months it runs (start month through start + duration \u2212 1). The contractor pays 80% of each month's cost in that month and the rest in the following month. It bills each month's cost plus 8% markup at the end of that month; the owner withholds 10% retainage and pays the rest 2 months after the billing month. All retainage is released in one payment in the third month after the last month of work. Cash position starts at 0 before month 1; the position for a month is the running total of receipts minus payments through the end of that month.\n\nGive the largest deficit (as a negative number), the month in which it occurs, the first month after that in which the position is zero or better, and the final cash position after the retainage payment.\nAnswer keys: \"peak_deficit\" (number), \"peak_deficit_month\" (integer), \"first_month_back_to_positive\" (integer), \"final_cash_position\" (number).", "answer": {"peak_deficit": -3205334.53, "peak_deficit_month": 10, "first_month_back_to_positive": 15, "final_cash_position": 707920.0}, "fields": {"peak_deficit": {"kind": "number", "rel_tol": 0.001, "abs_tol": 0.0}, "peak_deficit_month": {"kind": "integer", "rel_tol": 0.0, "abs_tol": 0.0}, "first_month_back_to_positive": {"kind": "integer", "rel_tol": 0.0, "abs_tol": 0.0}, "final_cash_position": {"kind": "number", "rel_tol": 0.001, "abs_tol": 0.0}}, "meta": {"activities": 9, "family": "cashflow_forecast", "seed": 20261016}, "attachments": []}
